  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/711081b9-ec6c-4bc3-9f1a-90b101d27189.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.52014in;height:1.72014in\" /></p><p>Circle drawn by taking <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> as diameter passes through vertex hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>V</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the mid-point of the chord<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the locus of the conic is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Length of the latus rectum (smallest focal chord)&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
    "image": null
